2. Rebuild it using this config-driven approach
3. Compare:

   * lines of code
   * clarity
   * flexibility

If it feels better → migrate others
If not → keep hybrid

---

## Bottom line

* ✅ Your idea is **very plausible**
* ✅ Registry + generic enricher is the right level
* ✅ You can avoid file-per-enricher
* ❌ Don’t try to remove Python entirely from the system

