```

The generic one is for expansion. The named helpers are for common workflows.

## Final mental model

```text
records/dataframe
  ↓
formatter
  ↓
request contract
  ↓
registry lookup
  ↓
prompt composition
  ↓
LangChain structured output
  ↓
response contract
  ↓
validated enrichment result
```

This gives you dynamic enrichment selection without making schemas flimsy or hiding important logic in config blobs.
